# Golden: roadmap 9100 feel-genre swing pass — "swing" style, varD (the busiest
# ride pattern), one held Cmaj7. Locks the engine-driven swing (D-implementer
# spec docs/proposals/per-style-feel-swing-reauthoring.md): the ride's off-8ths
# now sit on the straight grid (steps 2/6/10/14) and groove::apply pushes them
# late by (480*62)/300 = 99 ticks, landing at 579/1539/2499/3459. On-beats
# (steps 0/4/8/12) stay at exact step*240 (0/960/1920/2880) — the groove offset
# is zero there. This golden is the regression guard for that feel: any
# accidental change to swing.hpp's .groove or its re-authored ride table would
# move these ticks and fail this test.
key C major
port open out virt as synth
chord out synth:4
style load swing
style route drums synth:10
play C
style section varD
transport start
advance 3840
quit
